Z||000007||Pontiaddict||07-30-2001||10:31 PM||||I give the advantage to Barney. Though he isn't as manuverable as the bird, he has more padding and it's of better quality than feathers.<P>Why not throw in the bear in the big blue house and make this a 3 way bout? If so, the bear has the clear advantage.<P>You would have to make a different 3D model to have a decent looking Big Bird or Barney skin in Quake and Unreal. For those that like to cheat, you can make all the skins bright neon green with targets on them. The only thing liked about Quake 3.<P><BR>You can change the cars in GTA. I can't remember how to do it anymore though. It's also easy to get the tank to go 300mph and make the cars indestructable. (a good attribute for anything that hits stuff when they're going 300mph)<P>||||reg||1
